# The image is built from the manifests, the sources and the fixtures, and
# nothing else. Everything is excluded and those are let back in: `target/`
# alone is many gigabytes, and a build context that sends it is one that
# takes minutes before the first step runs.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!apps/
!fixtures/
!docs/island/DEPLOYMENT.md
**/target
